Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 14:08:47 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 17/18] The example restricted's fix-smooth fixes other parts
 for the trades study's controls: with --rough the candidates outside the
 smooth part (some prime above B), and with --random K only K candidates of
 the part, drawn at random with --seed R, the rest free; its line gives rough,
 random and seed, and the barred list beside the fixed one

---
 solver/frame/examples/restricted.rs | 54 +++++++++++++++++++++++------
 1 file changed, 44 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

